<https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf> <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#bug-database> <https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf/issues> .
<https://github.com/Blackcat-Informatics/purrdf> <http://usefulinc.com/ns/doap#description> "PurRDF built from source commit 77fc58ee4d7b35b21f56b3a434c318168627e2f2, run against the W3C data-shapes test suite at commit 40231dfb97c5b606d22ae733947c0d14b4f45c07, graded under the shacl-ed-2026-11-06 profile. That law is selectable on every host: `purrdf validate --shacl-profile shacl-ed-2026-11-06` on the command line, and the `shacl_profile` keyword (Python), the `shaclProfile` argument (WebAssembly) and the `shacl_profile` argument of `purrdf_shacl_validate_to_sarif_law` (C)" .
